;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\深淵からの呼び声.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家2階.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜寝るバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Sorry for waking you up all of a sudden..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Eri-nee<STYLE ID="1">, what's wrong...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> had only just fallen asleep, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> had been dragged back to reality by waking up.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I'm worried most of all about </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> has her parents to think about, and yet I'm trying to make her talk without even letting her rest enough.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">But I know. </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> isn't a weak person.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">It's one of the reasons I'm attached to </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">.</STYLE><PG>
"I know this is a bad time, but my head's already at its limit... 
{PAUSE ""}
So I was hoping I could hear something from the two of you..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mm-hm... I'll try hard for </STYLE>Eri-nee<STYLE ID="1">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> answered, rubbing her eyes.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">...</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="2">... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Let me help too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I... I really want to catch the culprit!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Just as I thought, she's exactly the person I believed she was.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">It's at times like this that </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> is strong.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">However bad things get, she tries her hardest to do whatever she can right now.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">―Since I was in front of </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, I avoided the theory that </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> was the culprit and explained that I would try to approach the culprit through the drug.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> listened without taking her eyes off me, while </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> wore a look that said she had no idea what I was talking about.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Judging from </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, maybe not everyone in Arata knows about the drug.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜手を上げるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Eri-nee<STYLE ID="1">, even without a drug like that, I'm strong!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"No... that's not what I mean. Do you know about that drug?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hmm... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Feels like I've heard of it... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">and like I haven't..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Then is there anyone who seems like they might have used a drug like that? 
{PAUSE ""}
　Like someone who suddenly got really strong, or who suddenly got faster at running..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Hmm... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Probably... nobody... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">If there was a drug like that, I bet everybody'd use it and go hunting!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I see. It's true: if something like that existed, they could hunt efficiently even while holding their movements back enough to keep their bodies from breaking.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I judged that </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> was most likely not lying.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="2">, about that: earlier, when we were doing fireworks, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Erika-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> said something. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">That they used to make some kind of drug in the past, but it's been disposed of now."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">If that's true, it means there was a faction that went on making the drug in secret.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Making a drug without anyone finding out would be impossible without at least a few collaborators.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">And the drug can't keep for decades either, so they must have been making it somewhere in this settlement.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田集落1.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Which means even this small settlement isn't of one mind.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Erika-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> has a faction rebelling against her beneath the surface.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">If its leader is </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, wouldn't a lot of things start to connect?</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">In other words, the faction that kept making the drug―its mastermind is </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">...?</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\ドローガ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">No, that's entirely possible.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">If they started making the drug again, they would want to test its effects.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Suddenly trying a drug that hadn't been used in decades on their own bodies isn't something they could easily do.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">What the Megasawa affair really was, then, was a drug experiment.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\能面セット.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Send her a Noh mask and red robes, and deliberately have her dress in a way that plainly marks her as someone from the Arata settlement.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Niimura-senpai's mother</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> probably sees the Noh mask as a way to hide her face, but to anyone else, it shows she's from Arata.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">To make use of an item that contradictory, she needs to move in ways no human could.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">That's why she has to use the drug.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">I don't know why the drug was made, but sure enough, the only one who could have slipped the drug into the supplies is </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">But there are still a lot of mysteries left.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\エデン\サクラ死体首なし.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">I don't know why Kikyo-san alone died in February, and I don't know why </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Sakura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s head was cut off either.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">All sorts of things that seemed unrelated have come together like this.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">These mysteries will probably connect as well.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="2">, are you okay? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\新村本家2階.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜寝るバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">　You've been lost in thought this whole time..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE>Eri-nee<STYLE ID="1">... I'm sleepy..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Ah, sorry. Yes, I've pretty much worked out my deduction. 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE>, I'd like to ask you a little about your <STYLE ID="4">dad</STYLE>..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"About </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">...?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> is the culprit, let's say. Then if he gets arrested, what happens to </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s future...</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">But thinking about that would be playing right into </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kotaro-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s hands.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">I know it's heartless of me, but I still can't forgive whoever killed </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s parents...!</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s super nice! When I learn to do all kinds of stuff, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Daddy</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> praises me!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Sleepy a moment ago, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s face broke into an innocent smile.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE>Goto<STYLE ID="2">, that's..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yes..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> seemed to have realized what I was thinking.</STYLE><PG>
"For example, what kinds of things does he praise you for?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ummm... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Hunting, for sure! Last fall I took down a great big bear all by myself! Isn't that amazing!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"A... a bear!? 
{PAUSE ""}
　That's... amazing... 
{PAUSE ""}
How did you hunt it?"<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Well, obviously, um... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">What you'd call a surprise attack? I stabbed it from up in a tree!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">'s athletic ability would let her ambush it from a tree, but even so, I feel like she'd be far too light...</STYLE><PG>
"But that way, you couldn't take it down in one blow, right?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\夏菜手を上げるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Yup! I jumped down from the tree and climbed back up lots of times! </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　I think it took about 10 tries to beat it... I'm the best hunter in Arata right now!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Even if she can do this much, she surely hasn't used that drug.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">If she had, the strain would be too much, and her whole body would soon be wrecked.</STYLE><PG>
"What weapon did you use to take it down?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Well, obviously...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<EVENT VALUE="TEXTCLEAR">
<PG>
{CREATECG "111" "グラフィック\背景\黒塗り.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
